{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 16 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生理时序模型：门控、膨胀卷积、长状态与领域预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Temporal Physiological AI</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_077_lstm-title\">LSTM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">带门控的加性 cell memory 与 recurrent hidden state 分离，使长期信息可选择性保留和读出。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Separates an additive linear cell memory state c_t (governed by forget and input gates) from the non-linear recurrent hidden state h_t to preserve long-term temporal gradients.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">时间序列 x_1...x_T</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sequential physiological waveform or longitudinal clinical time series x_1 … x_T</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">逐时刻隐藏状态或序列级预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Step-wise hidden states h_t or sequence-level diagnostic prediction</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.7</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1162/neco.1997.9.8.1735\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_077_lstm')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_077_lstm')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"LSTM original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/690b3687de8c5d810a5b.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.7</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_077_lstm\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_077_lstm')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_077_lstm\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 x_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input x_t</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">当前 ECG/EEG/临床变量向量</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests sequential physiological waveform or longitudinal clinical time series x_1 … x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (input x_t).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"当前 ECG/EEG/临床变量向量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests sequential physiological waveform or longitudinal clinical time series x_1 … x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (input x_t).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入 x_t\" data-node-name-en=\"input x_t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 x_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input x_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">当前 ECG/EEG/临床变量向量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests sequential physiological waveform or longitudinal clinical time series x_1 … x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (input x_t).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"前一时刻短期隐藏状态与长期 cell memory\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes h_{t-1}, c_{t-1} to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"h_{t-1}, c_{t-1}\" data-node-name-en=\"h_{t-1}, c_{t-1}\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>h_{t-1}, c_{t-1}</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">前一时刻短期隐藏状态与长期 cell memory</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes h_{t-1}, c_{t-1} to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"sigmoid 门控制写入、保留与读出；forget gate 属后来成为标准的现代 LSTM 式\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs i/f/o within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"i/f/o 门\" data-node-name-en=\"i/f/o\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">i/f/o 门</span><span class=\"lang-en\">i/f/o</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">sigmoid 门控制写入、保留与读出；forget gate 属后来成为标准的现代 LSTM 式</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs i/f/o within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"tanh(W_x x_t+W_h h_{t-1}+b) 提议写入内容\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs g_t within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"候选记忆 g_t\" data-node-name-en=\"g_t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">候选记忆 g_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">g_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">tanh(W_x x_t+W_h h_{t-1}+b) 提议写入内容</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs g_t within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"现代式 c_t=f_t⊙c_{t-1}+i_t⊙g_t，形成加性记忆通路\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Cell update within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Cell 更新\" data-node-name-en=\"Cell update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Cell 更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Cell update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">现代式 c_t=f_t⊙c_{t-1}+i_t⊙g_t，形成加性记忆通路</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Cell update within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"h_t=o_t⊙tanh(c_t)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Hidden update within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Hidden 更新\" data-node-name-en=\"Hidden update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Hidden 更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Hidden update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">h_t=o_t⊙tanh(c_t)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Hidden update within the core gated recurrent memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对 h_t 逐点预测，或聚合 h_1...h_T 做序列分类\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies sequence to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"时间/序列头\" data-node-name-en=\"sequence\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">时间/序列头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sequence</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对 h_t 逐点预测，或聚合 h_1...h_T 做序列分类</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies sequence to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"事件、节律、状态或连续值\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces step-wise hidden states h_t or sequence-level diagnostic prediction via prediction.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"预测\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_077_lstm', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预测</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">事件、节律、状态或连续值</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces step-wise hidden states h_t or sequence-level diagnostic prediction via prediction.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"LSTM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · LSTM 门控记忆与隐藏状态更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Gated Additive Constant Error Carousel Cell Update: c_t = f_t ⊙ c_{t-1} + i_t ⊙ c̃_t</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"LSTM：核心公式 · LSTM 门控记忆与隐藏状态更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"77\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.171088pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-67.540013 -69.079189 340.80549 9.171088\" width=\"340.80549pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m077_g4-0\"></path><path d=\"M4.485001-1.862109C4.485001-3.064872 3.506851-4.043022 2.304088-4.043022S.123175-3.064872 .123175-1.862109S1.101325 .318805 2.304088 .318805S4.485001-.659346 4.485001-1.862109ZM4.158951-1.862109C4.158951-.840485 3.318466-.007246 2.304088-.007246C1.282464-.007246 .449225-.840485 .449225-1.862109S1.282464-3.716972 2.304088-3.716972C3.318466-3.716972 4.158951-2.883733 4.158951-1.862109ZM2.702594-1.862109C2.702594-2.086721 2.514209-2.275106 2.296842-2.275106S1.898337-2.093967 1.898337-1.862109C1.89